From 871d5d146acb535990eaef52a5347a5b08997ff6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MicroNUX <micronux@example.invalid>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 12:22:35 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 23/47] video: fbdev: adopt triple-buffer IRQ-rearm scanout

Replace the inherited circular auto-reload contract with ABI v2, three
protected RGB565 framebuffers, and one marked-last descriptor per buffer.
Render only into a non-front buffer, batch fbcon primitives into complete
frames, rotate roles only after successful transfer-completion rearm, and
explicitly rearm the selected descriptor from the DMA interrupt.

Signed-off-by: MicroNUX <micronux@example.invalid>
